## [S3c] 기본 order — @PreAuthorize("@ownerCheck.check(#id)") 안의 Transaction 상태
ownerCheck(@Transactional(readOnly = true)) 안: isActualTransactionActive=true isCurrentTransactionReadOnly=true
byId 본문(@Transactional 없음): body active=false
ownerCheckPlain(@Transactional 없음) 안: isActualTransactionActive=false
byIdPlain 본문: body active=false
